          <head n="2" source="#source-820-931"><seg source="#source-841-850">（一）</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-850-874"><rb>森林</rb><rt>しんりん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-874-877">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-877-901"><rb>效用</rb><rt>こうよう</rt></ruby></head>
