        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-73163-73175"><rb>次</rb><rt>つ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-73175-73181">ぎに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-73181-73211"><rb>富山縣</rb><rt>とやまけん</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-73211-73241"><rb>高岡市</rb><rt>たかをかし</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-73241-73277"><rb>末廣町</rb><rt>すゑひろちよう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-73277-73286">にある</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-73286-73319"><rb>七本杉</rb><rt>しちほんすぎ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-73319-73325">は、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-73325-73349"><rb>地上</rb><rt>ちじよう</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-73349-73373"><rb>五尺</rb><rt>ごしやく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-73373-73388">のところで</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-73388-73412"><rb>幹廻</rb><rt>みきまは</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-73412-73415">り</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-73415-73463"><rb>六十六尺</rb><rt>ろくじゆうろくしやく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-73463-73466">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-73466-73478"><rb>木</rb><rt>き</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-73478-73481">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-73481-73496"><rb>高</rb><rt>たか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-73496-73499">さ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-73499-73538"><rb>二十餘間</rb><rt>にじゆうよけん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-73538-73541">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-73541-73565"><rb>樹齡</rb><rt>じゆれい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-73565-73568">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-73568-73601"><rb>一千年</rb><rt>いつせんねん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-73601-73604">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-73604-73619"><rb>稱</rb><rt>とな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-73619-73649">へられてゐ