        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-78341-78356"><rb>高</rb><rt>たか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-78356-78359">い</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-78359-78374"><rb>山</rb><rt>やま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-78374-78377">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-78377-78392"><rb>登</rb><rt>のぼ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-78392-78401">られた</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-78401-78416"><rb>人</rb><rt>ひと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-78416-78434">は、だれでも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-78434-78452"><rb>氣付</rb><rt>きづ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-78452-78464">づてゐる</seg><note type="sic" source="#source-78464-78506">「氣付づてゐる」はママ</note><seg source="#source-78506-78524">ことですが、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-78524-78539"><rb>山</rb><rt>やま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-78539-78542">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-78542-78554"><rb>生</rb><rt>は</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-78554-78557">え</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-78557-78572"><rb>茂</rb><rt>しげ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-78572-78584">つてゐる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-78584-78608"><rb>樹木</rb><rt>じゆもく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-78608-78611">も</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-78611-78629"><rb>麓</rb><rt>ふもと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-78629-78632">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-78632-78659"><rb>中腹</rb><rt>ちゆうふく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-78659-78680">とでは、まるで</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-78680-78704"><rb>種類</rb><rt>しゆるい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-78704-78728">がちがつてをり、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-78728-78767"><rb>頂上近</rb><rt>ちようじようちか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-78767-78785">くになると、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#sou